feat: Study Mode — interactive AI tutor with diagrams, saved into notes

An interactive study companion (icon rail: graduation cap). A Socratic tutor
teaches in small steps, asks you questions back, and renders Mermaid diagrams,
timelines, and study schedules inline — like GPT/Gemini study mode. Any answer
or diagram saves into the current note (whole message, or select text first to
save just that). Anchored to the open note as the topic, so a course folder
becomes a set of tutored notes.

- Mermaid.tsx: theme-aware diagram renderer (flowchart/timeline/mindmap/gantt),
  validates before render so partial mid-stream diagrams don't throw.
- StudyMarkdown.tsx: react-markdown + remark-gfm, renders mermaid fences live.
- study scope + Socratic tutor prompt in /api/ai/ask (mock includes a timeline).
- Editor preview now renders saved mermaid blocks as diagrams.

